+
+The initial mixed run and same-APK quiet replay preserved 45s native timeouts. Four opt-in QA thread samples caught LearningMemoryStore.sourceSuppressed repeatedly performing protected-key/HMAC work across an affected profile's 151 sources, although its suppression set was empty. The production change short-circuits empty-set membership to false; nonempty membership/all-revision logic and LearningMemoryStore.read's portable-key checks are unchanged. No key cache, source pruning, schema or permission change occurs. The isolated missing-key native control must still fail closed with its source row intact. See HISTORY_PROJECTION_CONTRACT.md and the separate original/fast-path APK cohorts in this batch's evidence.
